tSize="24" fontStyle="BOLD" color="#12161F" textAlign="LEFT" height="1.0">⑥ 同⑤ 再加圆形裁剪</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="960" top="598" width="320" height="26"><Text fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" fontStyle="NORMAL" color="#5A6478" height="1.0">与⑤ 完全相同的效果</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="960" top="626" width="320" height="26"><Text fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" fontStyle="NORMAL" color="#5A6478" height="1.0">再用 ClipOval 限定圆形</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="960" top="654" width="320" height="26"><Text fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" fontStyle="NORMAL" color="#5A6478" height="1.0">裁剪边界清晰可见</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="960" top="690" width="320" height="240"><Stack><Positioned left="0" top="0" width="320" height="240"><Container width="320" height="240" color="#FFFFFF"/></Positioned><Positioned left="70" top="30" width="180" height="180"><ClipOval clipBehavior="ANTI_ALIAS"><ColorFiltered color="#F6B94A" blendMode="MULTIPLY"><ImageFiltered sigmaX="6" sigmaY="6" tileMode="CLAMP"><Stack clipBehavior="NONE"><Positioned left="0" top="0" width="180" height="44"><Container width="180" height="44" color="#16202E"/></Positioned><Positioned left="0" top="60" width="76" height="60"><Container width="76" height="60" color="#16202E"/></Positioned><Positioned left="104" top="60" width="76" height="60"><Container width="76" height="60" color="#16202E"/></Positioned><Positioned left="12" top="136" width="156" height="36"><Container width="156" height="36" color="#243447" borderRadius="6" boxShadow="0 6 12 0 #00000066"/></Positioned></Stack></ImageFiltered></ColorFiltered></ClipOval></Positioned><Positioned left="0" top="0" width="320" height="240"><Container width="320" height="240" border="1 SOLID #D7DCE5"/></Positioned></Stack></Positioned><Positioned left="160" top="964" width="1120" height="26"><Text fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" fontStyle="NORMAL" color="#12161F" height="1.0">重叠内部采样点为实验区坐标 (180,100)；① 与 ② 的预期 / 实测 RGB 见 composite-audit.json。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="160" top="994" width="1120" height="26"><Text fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" fontStyle="NORMAL" color="#5A6478" height="1.0">③–⑥ 逐格判定（文字是否清晰、背景是否模糊、效果是否外溢）及其依据的文档原文见 composite-audit.json。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="160" top="1024" width="1120" height="26"><Text fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" fontStyle="NORMAL" color="#5A6478" height="1.0">128/255 ≈ 0.50196 是把 0.5 量化到 8 位 alpha 的结果，0.5 是精确值。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="160" top="1054" width="1120" height="26"><Text fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" fontStyle="NORMAL" color="#5A6478" height="1.0">① 的蓝叠在已合成的红上；② 的蓝先在组内盖住红，再整组半透明一次。</Text></Positioned></Stack></Container></Snapshot>